{"seq":18,"slug":"mao-military-thought","title":"毛泽东军事思想","stage":"DONE","category":"mao-zedong-studies","categoryLabel":"毛泽东研究","chapterCount":4,"docCount":10,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-military-thought","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.67,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.1,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/01_mao-zedong-studies/18_mao-military-thought","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"毛泽东军事思想-简介\">毛泽东军事思想 简介</h1><p>毛泽东军事思想是毛泽东思想的重要组成部分，是马克思主义军事理论与中国革命战争实践相结合的产物。它系统回答了在敌强我弱的条件下如何以劣势装备战胜优势敌人这一核心军事命题，创造性地发展了人民战争理论、军事辩证法和党对军队绝对领导的原则，形成了独具特色的无产阶级军事科学体系。</p>\n<p>本知识库适用于希望系统了解毛泽东军事理论的读者，包括军事史研究者、战略学习者、对中国革命战争史感兴趣的历史爱好者，以及希望从军事思想中汲取战略思维方法的一般读者。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>理论体系</strong>，系统阐述毛泽东军事思想的三大理论支柱：人民战争理论揭示了战争伟力存在于民众之中的根本规律，军事辩证法提供了分析战争矛盾运动的方法论工具，党指挥枪原则确立了人民军队的根本建军路线。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>战略战术</strong>，深入解析毛泽东在长期战争实践中总结提炼的具体军事原则与战术方法，包括指导人民解放军作战的十大军事原则、游击战争的&quot;敌进我退、敌驻我扰、敌疲我打、敌退我追&quot;十六字诀，以及集中优势兵力各个歼灭敌人的围歼战术体系。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>战争实践</strong>，以国内革命战争和抗日战争两大历史阶段为线索，分析毛泽东军事思想在具体战役和战略决策中的实际运用，展现理论与实践之间的辩证互动关系。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>影响与遗产</strong>，评析毛泽东军事思想对世界军事理论发展的深远影响，探讨其核心方法论在现代战略环境中的借鉴价值与应用前景。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径为：先通过第一章掌握军事思想的理论基础，再在第二章中理解具体的战略战术原则，随后在第三章中通过战争实践案例加深对理论的感性认知，最后在第四章中从更宏观的视野审视其历史地位与当代价值。理论学习与战史案例相结合，是深入理解毛泽东军事思想的最有效方法。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"theoretical-system","title":"理论体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-military-thought/theoretical-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"peoples-war-theory","title":"人民战争理论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-military-thought/theoretical-system/peoples-war-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"military-dialectics","title":"军事辩证法","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-military-thought/theoretical-system/military-dialectics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"party-commands-gun-principle","title":"党指挥枪原则","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-military-thought/theoretical-system/party-commands-gun-principle"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"strategy-tactics","title":"战略战术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-military-thought/strategy-tactics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ten-military-principles","title":"十大军事原则","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-military-thought/strategy-tactics/ten-military-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"guerrilla-warfare-sixteen-characters","title":"游击战十六字诀","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-military-thought/strategy-tactics/guerrilla-warfare-sixteen-characters"},{"seq":3,"slug":"encirclement-annihilation-tactics","title":"围歼战术体系","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-military-thought/strategy-tactics/encirclement-annihilation-tactics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"war-practice","title":"战争实践","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-military-thought/war-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"civil-war-campaigns","title":"国内革命战争战役","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-military-thought/war-practice/civil-war-campaigns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"anti-japanese-war-strategy","title":"抗日战争战略","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-military-thought/war-practice/anti-japanese-war-strategy"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"influence-legacy","title":"影响与遗产","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-military-thought/influence-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"world-military-thought-influence","title":"对世界军事思想的影响","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-military-thought/influence-legacy/world-military-thought-influence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"modern-strategic-applications","title":"现代战略应用","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-military-thought/influence-legacy/modern-strategic-applications"}]}]}